00:29:13.760 --> 00:29:19.360
Google it. Yeah. I think it's a nice, it's a nice payoff other than just like, you know, so many things that

00:29:19.360 --> 00:29:22.400
we see now, it's just like text that says like, you did it.

00:29:22.920 --> 00:29:27.460
Congratulations. Like you probably won, but later that same day, probably won.

