00:29:36.540 --> 00:29:37.960
So this, this is a Capcom joint.

00:29:38.140 --> 00:29:45.280
We talked about that. Some people believe that this is Capcom's actual, their first go at developing an NES

00:29:45.280 --> 00:29:49.480
game, uh, that the other ones were all like ports, uh, including 1942 though.

00:29:49.480 --> 00:29:54.880
