00:30:52.560 --> 00:30:54.860
Right, right. I thought the music in this game was pretty good.

00:30:55.260 --> 00:30:58.620
It was like one of those things where at first I was like, I don't, I don't know if

00:30:58.620 --> 00:31:01.900
