00:31:01.980 --> 00:31:03.380
Stockholm syndrome. Yeah.

00:31:03.780 --> 00:31:04.880
I did wind up liking it.

00:31:04.880 --> 00:31:09.900
And I think like that, that stage two one, um, the stage two is really good for some reason.

